    UC_DuyetHoSo -.->|<<include>>| UC_GuiThuMoi

    PH --> UC_VietReview
    UC_VietReview -.->|<<include>>| UC_DinhKemMedia
    PH --> UC_VoteHuuIch
    PH --> UC_ThaoLuanBlog

    style Sub_Community fill:#FAF8F5,stroke:#B8E0D2,stroke-width:1.5px

